and confirm your individual education plan before you are reported as an active student to the Norwegian State Educational Loan Fund, and to gain access to your subjects in Canvas, the learning platform."},"link":{"label":"Semester registration","href":"https://fsweb.no/studentweb/login.jsf?inst=FSHK","external":true,"showIsExternal":true}},{"heading":{"value":"SiO (Oslo) and Sammen (Bergen)"},"content":{"value":"SiO and Sammen offers housing, health services, kindergardens, fitness centers and much more to its members."},"link":{"label":"SiO (Oslo) and Sammen (Bergen)","href":"/en/for-students/student-welfare-organisations/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}},{"heading":{"value":"Loans and grants"},"content":{"value":"<span>All our study programs are&nbsp;publicly approved and give the right to apply for loans and grants from the&nbsp;Norwegian State Educational Loan Fund (</span><a href=\"https://www.lanekassen.no/nb-NO/Languages/About-the-Norwegian-State-Educational-Loan-Fund-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">L&aring;nekassen</a><span>).</span>"},"link":{"label":"Loans and grants","href":"/en/study-at-kristiania/admission-information/#praktiskinformasjon","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}}]},{"heading":"Starting your studies","items":[{"heading":{"value":"Services and adaptations"},"content":{"value":"<span>As a student, you can get guidance, adaptation and follow-up on study-related questions and challenges. We have a duty of confidentiality.</span>"},"link":{"label":"Services and adaptations","href":"/en/for-students/student-services/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}},{"heading":{"value":"Mitt Kristiania"},"content":{"value":"<span>This is where you get an overview of your schedule, syllabus, services and other tools you need as a student.</span>"},"link":{"label":"Mitt Kristiania","href":"/en/mitt-kristiania/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}},{"heading":{"value":"Student ID card"},"content":{"value":"<span>As a new student, you