<div id="30a71c11"><section id="frequently-asked-questions" class="B_EDxoOxVgAU8kPXBQWa"><h2 class="FrR9v_ssranAjR5kDzwF Lz7bstkpq5d6FanMqkLu">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="XmC_S2INgPyqbncnXLoy XL4KGq1qGQz8WwtKJ_pg"><div class="YKYBQ3jDmxdtO9SEemuL"><div class="uJgrlGAPM7ozrDvgjXt0"><ul class="csX3C9e9jiZog4fiK1f5"><li><div class="zsrYitxhmI4Rdxl8AcId te60PfIJAvlwZ2RBbGqe o80VkuFKdpLspcd2K6XW"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="AccordionItem__2194" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT GNG_gRf6Dl3NsaHoWAUO OyyOerhMVj5mV5WQNX5V xZxJs8W876NY1tCMuMwq UM1jfJqOS1COdaoBDFKC"><div class="YSRmfctHOQ5noBfQfMH5"><div class="DnD1xRazitrvmLCwsQvo"><h3 class="Y1lcLNcJwl0MgDDEuPIe">What equipment do I need?</h3></div><span class="SvgIcon MFUfNtxb_KMTBmiHESl8"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-plus"></use></svg></span></div></button><div style="will-change:height;overflow:hidden;visibility:hidden;height:0" class="ZgXVgEgkOVHpOr6mpnZu"><div id="AccordionItem__2194" class="pxYchGNIM3U95N_8sY2T"><div class="BcPDQdbKyOolxjjq14w1"><div class="RichtextContent">The most important thing you need for the bachelor's program in Computer Arts is a good laptop (not a Mac). We work with programs such as Unity 3D, Maya, Nuke, and Photoshop, so you will need a laptop that can run these.</p>
<p>Recommended laptop specifications:</p>
<ul class="ml-4 list-outside">
<li>Windows 10/11, 64-bit</li>
<li>Quad-core Intel or AMD processor, at least 2.5 GHz or faster</li>
<li>Graphics card with at least 4GB VRAM. Some good options are, for example, NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 or AMD Radeon RX 5600M</li>
<li>8 GB RAM or better</li>
</ul>
<p>*We also work with more demanding software such as Unreal Engine 5, VR technology, etc., but Kristiania has a dedicated PC lab available that we use for these tasks.</div></div></div></div></div></li><li><div class="zsrYitxhmI4Rdxl8AcId te60PfIJAvlwZ2RBbGqe o80VkuFKdpLspcd2K6XW"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="AccordionItem__2195" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT GNG_gRf6Dl3NsaHoWAUO OyyOerhMVj5mV5WQNX5V xZxJs8W876NY1tCMuMwq UM1jfJqOS1COdaoBDFKC"><div class="YSRmfctHOQ5noBfQfMH5"><div class="DnD1xRazitrvmLCwsQvo"><h3 class="Y1lcLNcJwl0MgDDEuPIe">Can I apply for an internship?</h3></div><span class="SvgIcon MFUfNtxb_KMTBmiHESl8"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-plus"></use></svg></span></div></button><div style="will-change:height;overflow:hidden;visibility:hidden;height:0" class="ZgXVgEgkOVHpOr6mpnZu"><div id="AccordionItem__2195" class="pxYchGNIM3U95N_8sY2T"><div class="BcPDQdbKyOolxjjq14w1"><div class="RichtextContent">In this program, you will have the opportunity to complete your entire bachelor's thesis at a company.</p>
<p>Kristiania has a long tradition of sending students out for internships. Spending part of your study period at a company can provide you with relevant work experience, new contacts in the industry, and serve as an exciting start to your new career.</div></div></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['30a71c11-json'] = {"id":"frequently-asked-questions","heading":{"value":"Frequently asked questions"},"accordionItems":[{"id":"134501","displayName":"What equipment do I need?","introText":{"value":"The most important thing you need for the bachelor's program in Computer Arts is a good laptop (not a Mac). We work with programs such as Unity 3D, Maya, Nuke, and Photoshop, so you will need a laptop that can run these.</p>\n<p>Recommended laptop specifications:</p>\n<ul class=\"ml-4 list-outside\">\n<li>Windows 10/11, 64-bit</li>\n<li>Quad-core Intel or AMD processor, at least 2.5 GHz or faster</li>\n<li>Graphics card with at least 4GB VRAM. Some good options are, for example, NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 or AMD Radeon RX 5600M</li>\n<li>8 GB RAM or better</li>\n</ul>\n<p>*We also work with more demanding software such as Unreal Engine 5, VR technology, etc., but Kristiania has a dedicated PC lab available that we use for these tasks."},"callToAction":null,"linkAsButton":false},{"id":"134922","displayName":"Can I apply for an internship?","introText":{"value":"In this program, you will have the opportunity to complete your entire bachelor's thesis at a company.</p>\n<p>Kristiania has a long tradition of sending students out for internships. Spending part of your study period at a company can provide you with relevant work experience, new contacts in the industry, and serve as an exciting start to your new career."},"callToAction":null,"linkAsButton":false}]};</script></div>
</div></div>
    </div>
</article>

    </main>
</div>

